### Description

**Observed Behavior**:

What I have seen on my cluster when I am testing short expire periods with Karpenter's disruption and replacement mechanism is that we are seeing empty status conditions are being added to the replacements as soon as the nodes join the clusters. You can see it here by looking at the `default-jltwh` NodeClaim.

```
{"level":"DEBUG","time":"2023-12-15T19:03:06.442Z","logger":"controller.nodeclaim.disruption","message":"marking empty","commit":"dcee782","nodeclaim":"default-jltwh"}
