My best guess at what is happening here is that our nomination window isn't working here. Ideally, even when the node gets initialized, even though a pod hasn't scheduled there yet, we would still assume that a pod _eventually_ schedules there. I'm wondering if we aren't rescheduling that pod to the node consistently in a way that causes us to keep refreshing the nomination window.

**Expected Behavior**:

Node shouldn't be marked for emptiness as soon as it gets initialized

